   "evidence": "Every call site (lines 93, 103, 151, 161) passes `Function.Embedding.refl _`, `fun _ \u21a6 rfl`, `S S`, `Finset.map_refl.symm`; `H \u2264 G` yields `V(H) \u2286 V(G)`, the reverse of `fV`'s direction.",
